blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!--\r\n  Hi there! Thank you for discovering and submitting an issue.\r\n\r\n  Before you submit this, make sure that the issue doesn't already exist\r\n  or if it is not closed.\r\n\r\n  Is your issue fixed on the preview release?: pip install pylint astroid --pre -U\r\n\r\n-->\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n1. Download pytest src\r\n2. cd pytest/src/_pytest\r\n3. python -m pylint logging.py  # raises AttributeError\r\n4. pylint logging.py  # no AttributeError is raised\r\n\r\n### Current behavior\r\n\r\nIf pylint is run using `python -m pylint` an AttributeError is output\r\n\r\n```\r\n> $ python3 -m pylint logging.py                                                               [±master ●●]\r\nCould not import runpy module\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/home/thomas/miniconda/lib/python3.6/runpy.py\", line 14, in <module>\r\n    import importlib.machinery # importlib first so we can test #15386 via -m\r\n  File \"/home/thomas/miniconda/lib/python3.6/importlib/__init__.py\", line 58, in <module>\r\n    import warnings\r\n  File \"/home/thomas/gitrepos/pytest/src/_pytest/warnings.py\", line 5, in <module>\r\n    import pytest\r\n  File \"/home/thomas/miniconda/lib/python3.6/site-packages/pytest.py\", line 8, in <module>\r\n    from _pytest.assertion import register_assert_rewrite\r\n  File \"/home/thomas/miniconda/lib/python3.6/site-packages/_pytest/assertion/__init__.py\", line 13, in <module>\r\n    from _pytest.assertion import rewrite\r\n  File \"/home/thomas/miniconda/lib/python3.6/site-packages/_pytest/assertion/rewrite.py\", line 9, in <module>\r\n    import imp\r\n  File \"/home/thomas/miniconda/lib/python3.6/imp.py\", line 31, in <module>\r\n    warnings.warn(\"the imp module is deprecated in favour of importlib; \"\r\nAttributeError: module 'warnings' has no attribute 'warn'\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\nNo exception\r\n\r\n### pylint --version output\r\n\r\n```\r\n> $ pylint --version                                                                           [±master ●●]\r\npylint 2.3.1\r\nastroid 2.2.5\r\nPython 3.6.7 | packaged by conda-forge | (default, Feb 28 2019, 09:07:38) \r\n[GCC 7.3.0]\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"PCManticore","id":448166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODE2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/448166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore","html_url":"https://github.com/PCManticore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/2952/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/2952/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}